# ChangeZoneAll exiles through GameAction.moveTo(ZoneType.Exile), which is
# GameAction.exile: Mode$ Exiled fires once per creature, so the AI's
# Soulherder gets a +1/+1 counter for each of the two Ghostway exiles.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 W
tapformana human 3 W
tapformana human 4 W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue cardorder 5,6
castspell human 1
resolvestack
